      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Jhin launches a magical cartridge at an enemy. It can hit up to four targets and gains damage each time it kills.",
      "summary_zh": "烬朝敌人扔出一颗迷人的手雷。它最多可以命中四个目标，并在每次击杀单位后获得伤害提升。",
