      "summary_en": "Jhin places an invisible lotus trap that blooms when walked over. It slows nearby enemies before dealing damage with an explosion of serrated petals. Beauty in Death - When Jhin kills an enemy champion, a lotus trap will bloom near their corpse.",
      "summary_zh": "烬放置一个隐形的莲花陷阱，陷阱会在敌人经过时绽放。它会减速附近的敌人，然后爆炸为一阵飘零的花瓣并对敌人造成伤害。 绚葬之华 - 当烬击杀掉一名敌方英雄时，一个莲花陷阱将在该英雄的尸体附近爆炸。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
